OL,3,ACanva announces major job cuts after
OL,4,A'our hardest year yet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanva, one of Australia's best known
OL,7,Fstart-ups, has announced a shake up of
OL,8,Fthe business that will affect 22% of
OL,9,Fits workers, including job cuts.
OL,11,FIn what was "without doubt the hardest
OL,12,Fmoment in our thirteen-year history"
OL,13,Fco-founder and CEO Melanie Perkins said
OL,14,F1,271 people would either lose their
OL,15,Fjobs, be asked to relocate or change
OL,16,Froles.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
