OL,3,ACanva announces major job cuts after
OL,4,A'our hardest year yet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm's value has reportedly dropped
OL,7,Fin the past year over concerns about
OL,8,Fthe impact of artificial intelligence
OL,9,F(AI) on its business as well as the
OL,10,Fcost of incorporating the technology
OL,11,Finto its platforms.
OL,13,FIt had been "our hardest year yet, and
OL,14,Fas we shared earlier this year, our
OL,15,Fgrowth has slowed for the first time in
OL,16,Fa decade," Perkins wrote to staff.
